Package: odp
Type: Package
Title: Ocean Data Platform R SDK
Version: 0.1.5
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Pål Erik", family = "Lystad", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "pal.lystad@hubocean.earth"))
Description: Lightweight R bindings for the Ocean Data Platform services.
    The package provides authenticated access to tabular datasets exposed by
    the HubOcean API and includes helpers for inspecting dataset metadata and
    streaming data batches into common R data structures.
